01:34.780 --> 01:36.280
My name is Asami.

01:36.570 --> 01:38.740
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

01:39.120 --> 01:41.580
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

01:41.580 --> 01:44.410
I'm actually married.

01:47.920 --> 01:49.540
So cute!

01:49.540 --> 01:50.920
Good morning.

01:52.500 --> 01:57.630
My husband, Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei,
teaches physics at my school.

01:58.470 --> 02:01.140
I'll start preparing breakfast.

02:01.180 --> 02:06.140
I Thought Today was The Day...

02:06.850 --> 02:08.560
Oh, Darling...

02:08.560 --> 02:10.940
Are you going to be late tonight?

02:10.940 --> 02:14.940
No. I'll be on time.
There's nothing going on today.

02:14.940 --> 02:16.360
That's great!

02:17.740 --> 02:18.780
Never mind...

02:18.780 --> 02:23.490
Even though we are a married couple,
we still haven't...

02:23.490 --> 02:25.580
...done "it," not even once.

02:26.330 --> 02:27.330
But...

02:27.330 --> 02:30.290
I'll win my husband's love today,
by hook or by crook.

02:31.250 --> 02:32.540
What!?

02:32.540 --> 02:34.170
You had a child!?

02:34.670 --> 02:35.510
Yes.

02:35.510 --> 02:36.800
Is this real life?

02:37.090 --> 02:39.720
Was it Ichimaru-sensei who knocked you up?!

02:39.720 --> 02:42.800
J-Just what do you mean by that?
I'm talking about <i>him.</i>

02:44.680 --> 02:46.100
His name is Kuri.

02:46.100 --> 02:47.640
Oh, that's all.

02:47.640 --> 02:49.350
He sure is cute.

02:49.350 --> 02:52.770
I know, right? I found him in the park.

02:53.400 --> 02:57.440
How nice. Hey, can we come and see Kuri-chan?

02:57.440 --> 02:58.400
Sure thing.

02:58.950 --> 03:01.740
Come to think of it,
where <i>do</i> you live?

03:03.870 --> 03:06.080
O-On second thought, you can't!

03:07.910 --> 03:09.160
Why not?

03:09.160 --> 03:13.840
Ah, that's right! I've got
urgent business in the library.

03:20.220 --> 03:22.300
I-Iwasaki-sensei.

03:26.470 --> 03:28.720
P-Please forgive me.

03:28.720 --> 03:31.140
Please don't run inside the school, okay?

03:31.140 --> 03:33.940
Okay. I apologize.

03:36.520 --> 03:38.610
Staff Room

03:45.370 --> 03:48.240
Do you think Iwasaki-sensei
has a boyfriend?

03:48.950 --> 03:51.540
It's just that whenever
I invite her out drinking,

03:51.540 --> 03:54.580
she always turns me down and claims to have other plans.

03:57.670 --> 04:00.590
Iwasaki-sensei is kind of pretty,

04:00.590 --> 04:02.840
and she <i>does</i> have a rather nice body.

04:03.970 --> 04:06.180
It wouldn't surprise me if she had one.

04:06.180 --> 04:09.810
Yeah, I guess she's taken.
Game over man, game over.

04:13.520 --> 04:15.400
Sonoda-sensei...

04:15.400 --> 04:18.110
She's got a man...

04:22.360 --> 04:24.530
Gotta make the best dinner ever.

04:24.990 --> 04:28.490
I sure hope my husband will like it.

04:32.580 --> 04:35.790
I forgot my book about
fixed star evolution theories.

04:46.010 --> 04:47.390
I-Iwasaki-sensei!

04:47.930 --> 04:51.720
She's getting it on...
and with a male student!

05:03.240 --> 05:05.360
U-Umm...

05:11.200 --> 05:12.160
She's crying?

05:25.380 --> 05:27.640
What did I witness back there?

05:28.510 --> 05:31.680
Did he force himself on her?
Nope, looked consensual to me.

05:31.680 --> 05:34.140
Iwasaki-sensei must've wanted<i>
to be with that student.</i>

05:35.810 --> 05:37.440
It can't be true.

05:44.190 --> 05:47.280
Today's the day when my husband will love me lots and lots.

05:54.540 --> 05:56.410
We can take our bath together.

06:00.460 --> 06:02.710
I love you, Asami.

06:02.710 --> 06:04.420
Darling...

06:05.880 --> 06:08.180
I-If only...

06:08.180 --> 06:09.340
I'm home.

06:09.340 --> 06:10.220
C-Coming!

06:14.390 --> 06:16.140
It sure looks good.

06:16.770 --> 06:18.640
You've outdone yourself, Asami.

06:19.270 --> 06:20.900
Darling...

06:22.610 --> 06:25.360
Don't you wish every day
could be like this?

06:26.940 --> 06:30.450
We haven't been able to eat dinner together this early...

06:30.450 --> 06:32.160
...in such a long time.

06:32.160 --> 06:33.450
That's true.

06:33.910 --> 06:37.540
I've been so swamped at work that I keep getting home late.

06:37.540 --> 06:40.580
U-Umm, Darling...

06:40.580 --> 06:42.080
What's the matter?

06:42.080 --> 06:43.880
U-Umm...

06:44.420 --> 06:46.170
T-Today...

06:46.170 --> 06:49.220
May we please take our bath together?

06:49.220 --> 06:50.300
What!?

06:57.680 --> 06:59.890
I-I'll get it.

07:01.600 --> 07:04.360
I-I will.

07:04.650 --> 07:07.070
S-Sorry.

07:10.740 --> 07:12.570
Hello?

07:13.160 --> 07:14.490
What!?

07:16.450 --> 07:17.750
You're going out <i>now?</i>

07:18.290 --> 07:19.500
Y-Yeah.

07:19.500 --> 07:22.420
O-One of my friends said

07:22.420 --> 07:25.670
t-that they wanted
to see me right away.

07:27.170 --> 07:28.880
I'm sorry.

07:32.510 --> 07:33.720
You know what...

07:34.390 --> 07:36.720
The master of the house has gone out.

07:37.260 --> 07:40.600
I hope he'll be home soon. Don't you?

07:56.410 --> 07:58.080
Oh, this is so bad.

07:58.950 --> 08:00.290
How could it not<i> be?</i>

08:02.000 --> 08:05.210
After seeing such a scandalous scene...

08:05.210 --> 08:07.090
What do I say?

08:07.090 --> 08:07.960
Umm...

08:07.960 --> 08:10.010
Y-Yeah?

08:10.710 --> 08:13.630
You saw us, didn't you?

08:14.390 --> 08:16.300
I-It's all right!

08:17.720 --> 08:20.890
You might not think it,
but I know how to keep a secret.

08:20.890 --> 08:23.600
I won't tell anyone,
so please don't worry.

08:35.030 --> 08:37.120
A-Again with the waterworks?!

08:37.120 --> 08:38.740
Ichimaru-sensei.

08:40.200 --> 08:41.950
Thank you.

08:43.000 --> 08:46.170
It's forbidden for students and teachers to love each other.

08:46.750 --> 08:48.250
I know that.

08:48.840 --> 08:49.670
But...

08:50.710 --> 08:54.470
I... If I fall in love, it's hopeless...

08:54.470 --> 08:56.430
I can't hold back.

08:57.010 --> 08:59.260
"Can't hold back"?

08:59.260 --> 09:02.930
It's all right.
I ended things with the student.

09:04.390 --> 09:05.600
But...

09:05.600 --> 09:09.690
I just wanted him to embrace me,
that one last time.

09:11.400 --> 09:15.740
O-Oh... I see, I'm sorry for inconveniencing you.

09:25.210 --> 09:27.630
You're so late, Darling.

09:29.710 --> 09:32.710
I hope he gets back soon...

09:34.970 --> 09:36.720
As a fellow teacher,

09:37.220 --> 09:40.010
do you look down on me for this?

09:40.010 --> 09:43.770
N-No, I wouldn't have the right to criticize you for that.

09:45.140 --> 09:48.480
After all, it's not like you and that student got marr--

09:48.900 --> 09:49.810
"Marr"?

09:51.980 --> 09:55.990
"Married to a student"... which I suppose isn't technically impossible.

09:55.990 --> 09:58.360
No, even I wouldn't go so far.

10:00.240 --> 10:03.290
W-Well, right, of course...

10:05.000 --> 10:06.210
Sensei?

10:07.330 --> 10:11.250
Ichimaru-sensei, you're a caring soul, right?

10:35.610 --> 10:36.860
I'm home.

10:49.790 --> 10:51.500
A-Asami...?

10:53.460 --> 10:54.960
Darling...

11:02.970 --> 11:03.970
I'm sorry.

11:04.720 --> 11:08.390
You tried to wait up for me...

11:09.310 --> 11:12.940
If you sleep out here, you'll catch cold.

11:21.320 --> 11:22.910
Good night.

11:34.630 --> 11:38.090
Ichimaru-sensei, you're a caring soul, right?

11:55.190 --> 11:57.980
Darling, it's time to wake up.

11:57.980 --> 11:59.820
You'll be late.

12:02.450 --> 12:05.910
Please hurry up and eat your breakfast...

12:06.870 --> 12:07.910
Asami?

12:09.240 --> 12:13.540
Here's your breakfast.
Please feast on it to your heart's content.

12:16.420 --> 12:17.920
Asami...!

12:20.800 --> 12:22.380
Yes?

12:26.140 --> 12:27.850
N-Nothing...

12:28.600 --> 12:29.930
I'm going to wash up.

12:32.270 --> 12:33.390
Darling?

12:33.440 --> 12:38.320
The Sakura Family Enters the Fray!

12:42.110 --> 12:44.030
My name is Asami.

12:44.030 --> 12:46.910
I'm a 17-year-old high school girl.

12:47.280 --> 12:50.910
I keep it secret from everyone, but...

12:50.910 --> 12:53.410
I'm actually married.

12:55.620 --> 13:01.380
My husband, Ichimaru Kyousuke-sensei,
teaches physics at my school.

13:03.840 --> 13:05.590
Okay, I'm leaving.

13:06.010 --> 13:08.260
Be on time, Asami.

13:11.010 --> 13:12.270
Darling?

13:17.440 --> 13:20.110
Hello? Good morning!

13:23.150 --> 13:27.570
I am your new next-door neighbor.
It's a pleasure to meet you.

13:28.450 --> 13:30.950
This is my little brother, Sasuke.

13:30.950 --> 13:32.490
C'mon, introduce yourself.

13:32.490 --> 13:34.960
Pleased to meetcha,
Onii-chan, Onee-chan!

13:35.500 --> 13:37.460
P-Pleased to make your acquaintance.

13:37.460 --> 13:38.960
Ooh, a handsome guy.

13:39.420 --> 13:43.460
Doesn't seem all that reliable,
but still good enough.

13:43.880 --> 13:48.140
My name is Mizunosaki Sakura, and the pleasure's all mine.

13:48.140 --> 13:50.430
Please, just call me "Sakura."

13:50.430 --> 13:54.680
O-Okay. My name is Ichimaru Kyousuke,
and I'm equally charmed.

13:54.680 --> 13:56.190
Ichimaru-san...

13:56.640 --> 13:58.400
Ichimaru-san, how old are you?

13:58.980 --> 14:01.150
I-I'm 25.

14:01.150 --> 14:02.610
Chance!

14:03.230 --> 14:05.940
Nothing, nothing.
Just talking to myself. And who's she?

14:06.740 --> 14:08.860
Oh, this is my w-

14:11.830 --> 14:15.830
Umm, I mean, she's my little sister.

14:15.830 --> 14:17.960
T-That's right.

14:17.960 --> 14:20.500
I am his younger sister, Asami.

14:21.590 --> 14:24.510
Asami-chan, right? Pleased to meet you.

14:24.510 --> 14:26.260
Ichimaru-san.

14:26.970 --> 14:30.010
This is my workplace.

14:27.630 --> 14:27.760
Gal Club
Sakurako
Open 365
Days a Year

14:30.430 --> 14:33.010
Stop by and see me sometime.

14:33.510 --> 14:38.520
I can make you feel better when you're all worn out.

14:47.070 --> 14:48.780
I'll see <i>you</i> later!

14:50.950 --> 14:52.700
What're you doing?

14:52.700 --> 14:54.120
Asami?

14:54.120 --> 14:56.700
If you don't get going, you'll be late.

15:00.870 --> 15:02.540
A cabaret club?

15:02.540 --> 15:04.460
Do you know what they're like?

15:04.460 --> 15:05.710
Not really...

15:05.710 --> 15:08.050
You really don't know about them?

15:08.050 --> 15:09.090
No.

15:09.090 --> 15:13.930
But I do wonder if they have anything to do with candy.

15:14.680 --> 15:19.350
Umm... Asami, that's not what cabaret clubs are about.

15:19.350 --> 15:21.900
Guys spend money, get drunk,

15:21.900 --> 15:25.230
and get some sexy service from the girls working there.

15:25.690 --> 15:29.320
No~ It's a totally adult world!

15:29.320 --> 15:31.360
<i>Now</i> do you understand?

15:31.360 --> 15:34.160
So they sell "dirty" candy?

15:35.240 --> 15:37.370
Enough about the candy.

15:37.370 --> 15:39.540
Put that candy away
in this imaginary box.

15:39.540 --> 15:45.500
Their "sexy service" includes <i>this</i> stuff and <i>that</i> stuff, among other things...

15:44.170 --> 15:47.710
It sounds like cabaret clubs are amazing places.

15:47.710 --> 15:50.260
This abnormal curvature in space

15:50.260 --> 15:54.260
cannot be explained without the General Theory of Relativity.

15:55.680 --> 15:58.850
Would my husband enjoy himself in a cabaret club?

16:00.430 --> 16:04.560
So Sakura-san works in a club like that?

16:04.560 --> 16:11.610
"Gal Club Sakurako"

16:05.150 --> 16:07.690
Okay, I'm off for today!

16:07.690 --> 16:09.740
Good work out there.

16:09.740 --> 16:11.610
Sakura-chan, well done.

16:12.950 --> 16:16.160
I'm exhausted. Sasuke, let's go.

16:16.160 --> 16:17.120
Sure!

16:17.530 --> 16:22.750
Honestly, you're seven years old.
Can't you look after yourself when I'm out?

16:25.460 --> 16:28.920
Well, at least you still have a great body.

16:29.590 --> 16:30.550
Yeah?

16:32.420 --> 16:35.550
This sexy body is sure to land a hot guy!

16:35.550 --> 16:36.890
Yeah!

16:44.650 --> 16:45.810
Umm...

16:46.520 --> 16:51.070
Y-You're a man, so do you like
going to cabaret clubs?

16:52.780 --> 16:57.280
I-I couldn't tell you one way or the other,
since I've never been to one.

16:59.580 --> 17:02.500
I'm sorry. That was an odd question.

17:04.080 --> 17:05.080
Yes?

17:05.870 --> 17:09.380
Hiya! Good evening!

17:09.380 --> 17:11.000
Good evening.

17:11.550 --> 17:13.670
G-Good evening.

17:14.090 --> 17:17.090
Has your brother returned from work yet?

17:17.090 --> 17:18.760
My brother?

17:18.760 --> 17:20.510
Ah... yes!

17:20.510 --> 17:22.810
If you'll excuse us...!

17:23.770 --> 17:25.060
We're back!

17:25.060 --> 17:27.100
U-Umm... what?

17:27.480 --> 17:29.190
Ichimaru-san.

17:29.650 --> 17:32.900
We're such good neighbors that we've stopped by to greet you again.

17:33.650 --> 17:36.200
So, shall we have a toast?

17:36.700 --> 17:38.950
Oh, okay.

17:46.960 --> 17:51.630
This is incredible! I never imagined
you were a school teacher, Ichimaru-san.

17:52.550 --> 17:54.340
It's not terribly impressive.

17:54.340 --> 17:56.880
So, are you married, Ichimaru-sensei?

17:56.880 --> 18:00.010
Umm, yeah, about that...

18:01.430 --> 18:06.020
Sadly, both my parents
died far too young...

18:06.390 --> 18:09.730
My younger brother, Sasuke,
and I have been

18:09.730 --> 18:12.110
living together alone
for such a long time.

18:12.980 --> 18:14.780
For my little brother's sake,

18:16.110 --> 18:17.280
I...

18:18.990 --> 18:22.620
I want to get married as soon as I can.

18:23.830 --> 18:25.250
Actually,

18:25.660 --> 18:29.330
I really wanna marry you, Ichimaru-sensei!!

18:29.750 --> 18:31.290
Darling!

18:32.960 --> 18:35.130
I mean, Onii-chan.

18:39.840 --> 18:41.390
Onii-chan!!

18:41.390 --> 18:44.680
I'm sooo lonely! I want a big brother!

18:44.680 --> 18:45.930
N-No! Hold on here, I mean...

18:45.930 --> 18:49.230
Ah, Sasuke, you poor, poor boy!

18:49.230 --> 18:52.810
Won't someone take pity on these siblings and love them just a little?

18:52.810 --> 18:54.230
Hey, wait...

18:52.810 --> 18:56.070
Umm, Sakura-san, hey...

18:54.230 --> 18:56.190
Let's get married right away!

18:56.190 --> 18:57.490
Onii-chan!

18:57.490 --> 18:58.860
My dear!

18:58.860 --> 19:00.530
Onii-chan!

19:02.820 --> 19:04.580
They wore themselves out.

19:05.120 --> 19:10.330
Yeah... I'll do the dishes,
so you can go and take a bath.

19:10.330 --> 19:11.170
Sure.

19:16.090 --> 19:18.300
Exit the twatblock, stage left.

19:21.800 --> 19:25.010
Sakura-san... what's with her?

19:25.600 --> 19:27.390
She was so forceful...

19:28.180 --> 19:30.730
My husband has me at his side.

19:31.560 --> 19:33.270
Yet I can't say...

19:34.730 --> 19:36.610
"I'm not his little sister."

19:37.940 --> 19:40.360
"I'm really his wife."

19:41.400 --> 19:43.530
W-What do you think you're doing!?

19:44.320 --> 19:46.450
Please don't, Sakura-san!

19:45.870 --> 19:47.120
Darling!

19:48.370 --> 19:51.580
Now, now, no need to be so shy.

19:51.580 --> 19:56.210
C'mon, I wanna get married as soon as possible!

19:56.210 --> 19:58.550
Ever heard of a <i>fait accompli?</i>

19:58.550 --> 20:01.800
S-Sakura-san, please stop doing that!

20:01.800 --> 20:06.010
No way! I can't keep selling my looks
for drinks and tips;

20:06.010 --> 20:08.100
I've got Sasuke's future to consider!

20:06.680 --> 20:08.100
Quit it!

20:08.520 --> 20:12.350
This is an adult moment,
so it's time for little sisters to butt out!

20:13.560 --> 20:15.230
T-That's...

20:17.440 --> 20:21.320
You are NOT raping him tonight!

20:24.450 --> 20:26.660
B-Because...

20:26.660 --> 20:27.410
I...

20:27.950 --> 20:29.660
A-Asami.

20:30.410 --> 20:33.420
I'm Ichimaru-sensei's...

20:36.130 --> 20:38.670
Ichimaru-sensei's...

20:39.460 --> 20:42.260
W-Wi...

20:42.920 --> 20:44.180
Asami!

20:53.600 --> 20:55.060
Was she in
the bath too long?

20:57.270 --> 20:59.230
What's the matter, Sasuke?

20:59.230 --> 21:04.320
I just got to thinking,
that if Asami-oneechan were my mom...

21:04.320 --> 21:05.490
...it'd be awesome!

21:06.160 --> 21:08.450
What do you mean, stupid son?

21:08.950 --> 21:09.910
"Son"?

21:10.410 --> 21:12.410
Oh, shit...

21:13.120 --> 21:15.500
You're... mother and son?

21:16.630 --> 21:19.380
Ah, no, whatever do you mean?

21:20.840 --> 21:23.170
I'm off now.

21:23.170 --> 21:24.840
Goodbye.

21:24.840 --> 21:26.430
Good morning!

21:26.930 --> 21:28.930
Ichimaru-sensei!

21:28.930 --> 21:32.270
G-Good morning...

21:32.270 --> 21:33.060
Bye.

21:33.060 --> 21:34.940
Okay, have a good day.

21:36.980 --> 21:40.400
There's something strange about those two.

21:40.400 --> 21:42.610
Asami-oneechan is so cool!

21:47.240 --> 21:50.490
Darling... it's so hard for me.

21:50.490 --> 21:54.290
We're a lawfully-wedded couple.

21:54.290 --> 21:58.580
Yet I wish I could've said,
"I'm your wife."

22:15.560 --> 22:19.060
All I am is a kitten

22:15.560 --> 22:19.060
watashi wa koneko

22:19.060 --> 22:22.980
All for you, and yours alone

22:19.060 --> 22:22.980
anata hitori dake no

22:22.980 --> 22:29.860
A naive little kitten; I want you to raise me right.

22:22.980 --> 22:29.860
mijuku na koneko sodatete hoshii no

22:30.410 --> 22:33.910
Can't you grant me this simple wish for anything

22:30.410 --> 22:33.910
nozomareru koto no subete ni

22:33.910 --> 22:38.080
and every last thing that I desire?

22:33.910 --> 22:38.080
kotaete yukeru kana

22:38.080 --> 22:41.500
If you stare at me with those longing, hungry eyes,

22:38.080 --> 22:41.500
nagai me de mitete kuretara

22:41.500 --> 22:47.420
I'll make this scene hotter and hotter just for you

22:41.500 --> 22:47.420
dokidoki sasete itte ageru

22:47.420 --> 22:54.810
Your kisses are like love vitamins,
so give me more and more of them.

22:47.420 --> 22:54.810
ai no bitamin kiss motto choudai

22:54.810 --> 23:01.730
Wrapped inside your loving arms so tight,
I can sleep again tonight.

22:54.810 --> 23:01.730
itoshii ude no naka kyou mo nemuru no

23:02.360 --> 23:11.870
Forever and ever only yours; just a kitten of love.

23:02.360 --> 23:11.870
zutto anata dake no ai no koneko

23:28.550 --> 23:44.520
Preview

23:29.170 --> 23:30.630
Asami here.

23:31.050 --> 23:35.140
What do you do when someone else falls in love with the one you love?

23:35.140 --> 23:39.430
I might be a little jealous,
but I have faith in him.

23:39.430 --> 23:43.190
So please, love me lots next week too.
